sequenceDiagram
  participant Client as Client
  participant API as FastAPI app
  participant DB as PostgreSQL + pgvector
  participant Ollama as Ollama

  Client->>API: POST /upload (PDF/DOCX, metadata) + JWT(admin)
  API->>DB: INSERT source_documents
  API->>DB: INSERT text_chunks (chunk_text, page_number)
  API->>Ollama: embeddings for chunks
  Ollama-->>API: vectors
  API->>DB: UPDATE text_chunks.embedding (via insert)
  DB-->>API: OK
  API-->>Client: {status: indexed, source_document_id, chunks_count}

